    "options": {
      "A": "Call the answer the word range alone.",
      "B": "Treat the estimate as the exact place-value sum and stop.",
      "C": "The whole-number parts give about $12+7=19$, and the tenths $0.8+0.3=1.1$, so a reasonable sum lies near $20.1$, not near $10$ or near $30$.",
      "D": "Say that a finished exact sum is what creates the place-value estimate he uses to check it."
